WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.321
Provenance is information about where media came from, how it was created or captured,

00:00:05.321 --> 00:00:07.559
and how it reached the analyst.

00:00:07.559 --> 00:00:12.035
It can include the original publisher, upload history, file lineage, timestamps, edits,

00:00:12.035 --> 00:00:13.527
transfers, and preservation records.

00:00:13.527 --> 00:00:16.510
Start with the claim, not only the file.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:20.613
Record what the post says happened, who or what it identifies,

00:00:20.613 --> 00:00:24.716
the alleged date and location, and the account making the claim.

00:00:24.716 --> 00:00:28.445
A real image paired with a false caption remains misleading.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.564
Reposts weaken context.

00:00:29.564 --> 00:00:32.921
They may crop watermarks, remove earlier captions, change dates,

00:00:32.921 --> 00:00:35.159
or combine media from different events.

00:00:35.159 --> 00:00:39.634
Trace backward toward the earliest available appearance and distinguish the first item

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.499
found from the original source.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:42.618
Platform context matters.

00:00:42.618 --> 00:00:45.229
Account history, correction notices, edits, comment chronology,

00:00:45.229 --> 00:00:48.585
and linked material can clarify how a claim developed.

00:00:48.585 --> 00:00:53.807
Popularity or verification badges do not prove that a specific media claim is accurate.

00:00:53.807 --> 00:00:58.282
Chain of custody records how evidence was obtained, stored, transformed, and reviewed.

00:00:58.282 --> 00:01:02.385
Preserve URLs, access times, available originals, hashes when required by policy,

00:01:02.385 --> 00:01:04.623
and notes about extraction or conversion.

00:01:04.623 --> 00:01:08.352
Do not overwrite the original with an edited working copy.

00:01:08.352 --> 00:01:11.336
Provenance often provides stronger evidence than appearance alone.

00:01:11.336 --> 00:01:16.184
An authenticated original recording with a documented chain may outweigh vague artifact concerns,

00:01:16.184 --> 00:01:20.660
while an untraceable viral clip remains uncertain even when it looks convincing.
